<title>POLAND: Jelfa Q4 net rises to PLN 4.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Jelfa Q4 net rises to PLN 4.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jelfa results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		     8.26   vs   5.17</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 8.19   vs   6.04</p>
<p>    net profit			     4.75   vs   1.36</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Jelfa SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     34.17   vs  26.82</p>
<p>    costs of sales			22.54   vs  20.15</p>
<p>    extraordinary			  0.00   vs   0.00</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax			     2.61   vs   1.87</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.83   vs   2.81</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.57   vs   1.31</p>
<p>    financial costs			0.63   vs   0.44</p>
<p>    investment			    32.24   vs  14.07</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p>    operating profit		    29.58  vs   23.84</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			30.89   vs  24.47</p>
<p>    net profit			    20.40   vs  13.58</p>
